WEBVTT

00:09:58.836 --> 00:10:00.956
This is one of the pathways
that it acts on.

00:10:01.716 --> 00:10:05.276
So it controls the production
of highly inflammatory molecules

00:10:05.276 --> 00:10:07.196
when the retina gets too stressed.

00:10:08.116 --> 00:10:09.956
124 is strong.

00:10:09.996 --> 00:10:12.476
It's a great worker,
helps the greater good.

00:10:12.516 --> 00:10:14.756
Exactly like a hero should.

00:10:15.756 --> 00:10:19.156
So we looked in the retinas
of AMD patients

00:10:19.156 --> 00:10:20.876
and what we found was this.

00:10:21.876 --> 00:10:24.156
124, stained in red,

00:10:24.156 --> 00:10:28.876
was completely absent
from the central retina of AMD patients

00:10:28.916 --> 00:10:31.156
compared to a healthy individual.